# Task 147-009: StaleWorkerDetector — Execution Plan

## Hedef
src/nervous/detectors/stale-worker.ts implementasyonu + 6 test

## Mevcut Durum
- src/core/nervous-types.ts: Tüm tipler mevcut (DetectorContext, DetectorResult, SprintStateSnapshot)
- src/nervous/detectors/ dizini: Var mı kontrol edilecek

## Adımlar

### 1. Dizin Yapısı
- src/nervous/detectors/ → var mı kontrol
- tests/nervous/detectors/ → var mı kontrol

### 2. src/nervous/detectors/stale-worker.ts
- StaleWorkerDetector class
- detectorId: 'stale-worker'
- staleThresholdMs: 180000 (3dk default)
- detect(ctx): sadece cron/filesystem source trigger
- IDLE/CLEANUP phase'de null döndür
- activeWorkers filtrele → now - lastHeartbeat > staleThresholdMs
- DetectorResult: risk='medium', severity='warning', groupKey içerir

### 3. tests/nervous/detectors/stale-worker.test.ts
6 test:
1. No active workers → null
2. All workers fresh HB → null
3. 1 stale worker → DetectorResult with 1 action
4. 2 stale workers → 2 actions, groupKey includes both IDs
5. event-bus event → null (only cron/fs trigger)
6. IDLE/CLEANUP phase → null

### 4. Verify
- tsc --noEmit
- npx vitest run tests/nervous/detectors/stale-worker.test.ts

## Notlar
- ctx.now inject edilebilir (test için deterministik)
- No fs imports needed (pure context-based detection)
